msgid "What&#8217;s new"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.0.0.CR2, our last step before building the 3.0."
"0.Final bits."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Please try it with your applications, the update is easy in a lot of cases,\n"
"and report any problem to us by https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"issues[creating a GitHub issue]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To upgrade your application to Quarkus 3.0, see <<upgrading,the instructions "
"below>>."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Among a lot of bugfixes and small enhancements, the highlights of this "
"release are:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Dev UI 2 is the default Dev UI"
msgstr ""

msgid "Gradle project update"
msgstr ""

msgid "Dev UI 2 by default"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Dev UI 2 is our brand new shiny Dev UI.\n"
"It is now the default you obtain when going to `/q/dev`\n"
"(but it's actually hosted at `/q/dev-ui`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The old Dev UI is still accessible at `/q/dev-v1`\n"
"and will be retired once we have ported all its features to Dev UI 2."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Yes, Dev UI 2 is not complete yet but it's already awesome so go test it and "
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[report back]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The `quarkus update` command now supports the update of Gradle projects to "
"Quarkus 3."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Have a Gradle project around? Give it a try and tell us https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/issues[how it works]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Trying out Quarkus 3"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
